          9*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435432) '+is+a+program+that+can+tell+whether+its+user+is+a+human+or+a+computer.+You%27ve+probably+seen%0D%0A%09%09%09them+-+colourful+images+with+distorted+text+at+the+bottom+of+Web+registration+forms.+CAPTCHAs+are+used+by+many+websites+to+prevent+abuse+from%0D%0A%09%09%09%22bots%22%2C+or+automated+programs+usually+written+to+generate+spam.+No+computer+program+can+read+distorted+text+as+well+as+humans+can%2C+so+bots%0D%0A%09%09%09cannot+navigate+sites+protected+by+CAPTCHAs.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ECAPTCHAs+are+often+used+to+protect+sensitive+functionality+from+automated+bots.+Such+functionality+typically+includes+user+registration+and+changes%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09password+changes%2C+and+posting+content.+In+this+example%2C+the+CAPTCHA+is+guarding+the+change+password+functionality+for+the+user+account.+This+provides%0D%0A%09%09%09limited+protection+from+CSRF+attacks+as+well+as+automated+bot+guessing.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EYour+aim%2C+change+the+current+user%27s+password+in+a+automated+manner+because+of+the+poor+CAPTCHA+system.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+issue+with+this+CAPTCHA+is+that+it+is+easily+bypassed.+The+developer+has+made+the+assumption+that+all+users+will+progress+through+screen+1%2C+complete+the+CAPTCHA%2C+and+then%0D%0A%09%09%09move+on+to+the+next+screen+where+the+password+is+actually+updated.+By+submitting+the+new+password+directly+to+the+change+page%2C+the+user+may+bypass+the+CAPTCHA+system.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+parameters+required+to+complete+this+challenge+in+low+security+would+be+similar+to+the+following%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E%3Fstep%3D2%26password_new%3Dpassword%26password_conf%3Dpassword%26Change%3DChange%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+has+attempted+to+place+state+around+the+session+and+keep+track+of+whether+the+user+successfully+completed+the%0D%0A%09%09%09CAPTCHA+prior+to+submitting+data.+Because+the+state+variable+%28Spoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3Epassed_captcha%3C%2Fspan%3E%29+is+on+the+client+side%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09it+can+also+be+manipulated+by+the+attacker+like+so%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E%3Fstep%3D2%26password_new%3Dpassword%26password_conf%3Dpassword%26passed_captcha%3Dtrue%26Change%3DChange%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EHigh+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThere+has+been+development+code+left+in%2C+which+was+never+removed+in+production.+It+is+possible+to+mimic+the+development+values%2C+to+allow%0D%0A%09%09%09invalid+values+in+be+placed+into+the+CAPTCHA+field.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EYou+will+need+to+spoof+your+user-agent+%28Spoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3EreCAPTCHA%3C%2Fspan%3E%29+as+well+as+use+the+CAPTCHA+value+of%0D%0A%09%09%09%28Spoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3Ehidd3n_valu3%3C%2Fspan%3E%29+to+skip+the+check.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EImpossible+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EIn+the+impossible+level%2C+the+developer+has+removed+all+avenues+of+attack.+The+process+has+been+simplified+so+that+data+and+CAPTCHA+verification+occurs+in+one%0D%0A%09%09%09single+step.+Alternatively%2C+the+developer+could+have+moved+the+state+variable+server+side+%28from+the+medium+level%29%2C+so+the+user+cannot+alter+it.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftr%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftable%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cp%3EReference%3A+' ]
